WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:10.520
Have you ever heard about that

00:10.520 --> 00:13.900
the cliff of a snow mountain

00:13.920 --> 00:19.590
once fascinated numerous people?

00:20.720 --> 00:23.960
Legend has it that,

00:23.960 --> 00:27.310
there were treasures at the peak

00:27.600 --> 00:33.230
but also there was a bottomless chasm hidden over there.

00:34.280 --> 00:37.740
The smart, the fool

00:37.760 --> 00:41.110
and the kind people,

00:41.200 --> 00:47.590
all are familiar to you.

00:47.920 --> 00:51.780
On the mountainside, on the cliff,

00:51.800 --> 00:54.780
on the cloud,

00:54.800 --> 01:00.470
and in the human world,

01:11.760 --> 01:19.590
snowflakes are drifting profusely and disorderly.

01:30.800 --> 01:34.800
Joy of Life Season 1

01:34.800 --> 01:38.030
Episode 27

01:50.300 --> 01:52.770
The lines are exactly the same.

02:13.180 --> 02:17.890
Even without the handwritten copy,

02:18.570 --> 02:20.640
we can see the truth.

02:22.180 --> 02:24.280
The latter four lines of the poem

02:24.900 --> 02:26.710
depict a desolated

02:26.730 --> 02:28.840
and frustrated life.

02:29.650 --> 02:32.040
Without going through

02:32.060 --> 02:33.970
ups and downs in life,

02:34.490 --> 02:37.810
how could anyone ever depict such an artistic conception?

02:38.980 --> 02:40.350
But Mr. Fan,

02:40.370 --> 02:42.330
you're successful and famous at a young age.

02:42.980 --> 02:45.060
How could you be so sad

02:45.060 --> 02:46.890
and desolated?

02:49.290 --> 02:52.000
When a young man tries to express sorrow,

02:53.090 --> 02:55.120
he would normally go too far.

03:07.340 --> 03:08.760
Your Majesty!

03:13.980 --> 03:14.830
Your Majesty!

03:14.850 --> 03:16.760
Fan Xian gains a reputation by deception.

03:16.780 --> 03:18.760
He's utterly shameless.

03:18.820 --> 03:20.160
By doing so,

03:20.180 --> 03:21.900
he has disgraced

03:21.900 --> 03:22.990
all the scholars of Nanqing.

03:23.010 --> 03:24.070
I beg Your Majesty to

03:24.090 --> 03:25.800
deprive him of his official title,

03:25.820 --> 03:26.820
expel him from the capital city,

03:26.820 --> 03:29.610
and never recruit him as an official again.

03:30.010 --> 03:31.240
Mr. Guo.

03:31.260 --> 03:32.180
Since I've disgraced

03:32.180 --> 03:33.470
Nanqing,

03:33.490 --> 03:35.840
why are you so happy?

03:35.930 --> 03:37.250
Nonsense!

03:38.060 --> 03:39.760
I'm just furious.

03:39.780 --> 03:42.070
I feel ashamed to be your colleague.

03:42.090 --> 03:44.010
When did you know that Master Zhuang

03:44.010 --> 03:46.000
would argue about the truth on the Hall?

03:54.260 --> 03:55.780
I just heard him of course.

03:55.780 --> 03:56.850
Then why did you say with certainty that

03:56.850 --> 03:57.990
I would be utterly discredited

03:58.010 --> 03:59.490
the moment I arrived at

03:59.490 --> 04:01.550
the Hall of Prayer for Good Harvest?

04:01.570 --> 04:03.400
Either you're good at fortune-telling,

04:03.420 --> 04:04.850
or you've hooked up with Master Zhuang

04:04.850 --> 04:06.760
in advance!

04:06.780 --> 04:08.370
Nonsense!

04:09.700 --> 04:10.290
How could you use "hook up" to describe

04:10.290 --> 04:11.680
my relationship with Master Zhuang?

04:11.700 --> 04:12.990
Stop it!

04:13.010 --> 04:14.350
At such a critical moment,

04:14.370 --> 04:16.090
just forget about the choice of words.

04:21.090 --> 04:22.310
Your Majesty,

04:22.330 --> 04:25.190
my son doesn't get along with Fan Xian all the time.

04:25.210 --> 04:28.240
Their dispute matters nothing.

04:28.260 --> 04:30.000
What's important now

04:30.020 --> 04:31.750
is Fan Xian's poem.

04:31.770 --> 04:33.860
Since he copied other's work,

04:33.860 --> 04:35.560
he should be severely punished,

04:35.580 --> 04:38.910
or the public anger

04:38.930 --> 04:41.130
won't be quelled.

04:42.330 --> 04:43.910
Minister, good for you.

04:43.930 --> 04:45.760
You pointed out the heart of the matter directly.

04:46.610 --> 04:48.960
I just spoke my mind impartially.

04:48.980 --> 04:50.410
Master Zhuang,

04:51.740 --> 04:53.530
you're right.

04:53.700 --> 04:57.760
I copied that poem from others.

04:58.540 --> 05:00.120
He really copied from other's work!

05:00.140 --> 05:01.580
How could he do that?!

05:01.580 --> 05:02.610
He's dishonest.

05:02.610 --> 05:05.320
I'm wrong about him.

05:05.890 --> 05:07.440
Mr. Fan,

05:09.020 --> 05:13.040
you're brave to admit your mistake.

05:13.540 --> 05:15.850
After this, you're sure

05:15.980 --> 05:17.910
to achieve great success in future.

05:17.930 --> 05:20.320
Stop flattering me.

05:21.210 --> 05:22.570
Master Zhuang,

05:22.980 --> 05:25.030
I copied poem for myself,

05:25.050 --> 05:26.610
and you copied poem for your teacher.

05:26.610 --> 05:28.800
We're no different.

05:28.820 --> 05:29.260
In fact,

05:29.260 --> 05:31.690
you're not as frank as I am.

05:32.210 --> 05:33.560
This poem

05:33.580 --> 05:35.170
is written by Du Fu, the Saint of Poem,

05:35.170 --> 05:36.590
who is also known as Shaoling Yelao.

05:36.610 --> 05:39.090
It has nothing to do with your teacher.

05:40.420 --> 05:44.200
Gaining fame for your teacher by deceiving the public,

05:44.460 --> 05:48.070
Master Zhuang is really a role model
of respecting teacher and honoring truth.

05:48.090 --> 05:49.690
The Saint of Poem?

05:52.420 --> 05:54.870
Which dynasty

05:54.890 --> 05:57.400
was he from?

05:57.420 --> 05:59.000
As the Saint of Poem,

05:59.020 --> 06:01.530
did he go down in history?

06:01.610 --> 06:03.600
We can't find him in historical records.

06:04.890 --> 06:06.280
I see.

06:06.300 --> 06:07.810
Because his poems

06:08.330 --> 06:10.640
are from another world.

06:11.020 --> 06:13.020
A world lasts for thousands of years

06:13.020 --> 06:15.160
and is filled with splendid poems.

06:16.580 --> 06:18.130
Is it the fairyland

06:19.170 --> 06:21.920
existed in legends?

06:25.020 --> 06:28.600
Feel free to laugh! Feel free to laugh!

06:28.860 --> 06:31.040
It's definitely the fairyland

06:31.420 --> 06:34.880
compared to your world.

06:35.460 --> 06:37.040
Have you been there?

06:38.820 --> 06:41.410
It's a picture scroll left from my dream,

06:42.610 --> 06:44.260
a memory left in my head.

06:44.260 --> 06:45.640
Your Excellency Fan,

06:45.820 --> 06:47.760
you mean

06:47.860 --> 06:51.040
you've travelled to the fairyland

06:51.650 --> 06:53.480
and recited a poem in your dream.

07:02.860 --> 07:04.070
Your Majesty,

07:04.090 --> 07:05.720
what Fan Xian said

07:05.890 --> 07:08.320
is utterly ridiculous.

07:09.460 --> 07:12.370
By making up such an absurd story,
he lied to Your Majesty.

07:12.490 --> 07:14.690
Your Majesty, I beg you to punish him!

07:18.300 --> 07:19.640
Master Zhuang,

07:20.170 --> 07:22.570
has your teacher written a lot of poems?

07:23.020 --> 07:26.370
My teacher has written many excellent poems.

07:26.650 --> 07:30.760
Does he have many unpublished poems?

07:31.580 --> 07:33.640
I've gone through all his works,

07:34.020 --> 07:35.760
and that is the only poem

07:35.890 --> 07:39.250
that remains unpublished.

07:45.210 --> 07:50.570
Who told you I only recited one poem in my dream?

07:57.260 --> 07:58.480
Give me paper.

07:59.490 --> 08:00.810
Give me ink.

08:01.980 --> 08:03.470
Mr. Fan,

08:03.490 --> 08:04.960
if you want to compose poems,

08:04.980 --> 08:08.040
I'd like to write them down for you.

08:12.370 --> 08:14.370
You want to

08:14.370 --> 08:16.690
improvise more poems

08:16.930 --> 08:19.650
to prove that you saw them all

08:19.650 --> 08:21.040
from the fairyland?

08:21.980 --> 08:23.960
You don't know.

08:23.980 --> 08:25.720
That memory

08:26.260 --> 08:28.330
is literally carved

08:28.330 --> 08:30.070
into my head.

08:30.090 --> 08:32.910
Every word I saw

08:32.930 --> 08:35.250
and every book I read,

08:35.370 --> 08:37.470
I can remember them clearly

08:37.490 --> 08:39.040
as if they're right in front of me.

08:40.220 --> 08:42.770
Do you know what you're talking about?

08:43.460 --> 08:44.950
I'm afraid he's so exasperated that

08:44.970 --> 08:47.280
he starts to talk nonsense.

08:57.020 --> 09:00.960
Don't you see the Yellow River pouring from heaven,

09:02.050 --> 09:06.080
rushing to the sea, never to return?

09:06.970 --> 09:12.570
Don't you see, in the hall
the mirror is saddened by the grey hair?

09:13.140 --> 09:18.120
Young and dark at dawn, but at dusk snowy!

09:18.140 --> 09:22.030
Ah, let's enjoy ourselves while we can.

09:22.050 --> 09:25.810
It's wrong to set goblets idle, in the glory of the moon.

09:26.930 --> 09:31.920
I was created by Heaven, certainly not for nothing.

09:32.410 --> 09:36.840
As for money, it scatters and gathers as money should.

09:42.290 --> 09:46.030
When will there be no more moon and spring flowers?

09:46.050 --> 09:48.890
For me who had so many memorable hours?

09:50.020 --> 09:53.640
If you ask me how much my sorrow has increased,

09:53.660 --> 09:58.840
just see the overbrimming river flowing east!

10:00.220 --> 10:02.720
I do not know in the celestial sphere

10:02.850 --> 10:05.580
what name this festive night goes by?

10:05.580 --> 10:09.130
I want to fly home, riding the air,

10:09.660 --> 10:13.150
but fear the ethereal cold up there.

10:13.170 --> 10:15.830
The jade and crystal mansions are so high!

10:15.850 --> 10:18.760
Dancing to my shadow,

10:18.780 --> 10:22.720
I feel no longer the mortal tie.

10:23.050 --> 10:26.370
Though drunk, we lit the lamp to see the glaive.

10:26.660 --> 10:30.210
Sober, we heard the horns from tent to tent.

10:31.100 --> 10:33.490
Under the flags,
beef grilled was eaten by our warriors brave.

10:33.490 --> 10:36.560
And martial airs were played by fifty instruments.

10:36.580 --> 10:39.890
It was an autumn maneuver in the field.

10:47.780 --> 10:52.570
We wished to fly in heaven,
two birds with the wings of one,

10:53.020 --> 10:56.830
and to grow together on the earth,
two branches of one tree.

10:56.850 --> 11:00.160
On the road ahead surely will be friends dear and true.

11:00.930 --> 11:05.040
Throughout the land is there anyone who knows not you?

11:06.020 --> 11:08.810
My attic which last night in vernal wind did stand.

11:09.820 --> 11:12.390
A few plum twigs at the corner of the wall

11:12.410 --> 11:14.030
blossoming all alone, defying the cold!

11:14.050 --> 11:16.350
Would you have me bow my head before mighty princes?

11:16.370 --> 11:18.660
On war-torn land streams flow and mountains stand.

11:18.660 --> 11:21.390
In vernal town grass and weeds are overgrown.

11:21.410 --> 11:23.920
Though I am white-haired, still I'd sing and drink my fill.

11:25.050 --> 11:29.290
Hating to part, hearing birds breaks our heart.

11:29.290 --> 11:32.320
We can't fly wing to wing like a pair of phoenixes,

11:32.340 --> 11:35.830
yet our hearts closely linked beat in harmony.

11:35.850 --> 11:38.830
Here's my precious horse, here's my priceless fur.

11:38.850 --> 11:42.450
Tell the boy to give them for the wine.

11:42.730 --> 11:45.920
I want to fly home, riding the air,

11:46.140 --> 11:49.650
but fear the ethereal cold up there.

11:50.410 --> 11:54.700
Hear spring rain falling in a small mansion all night!

11:54.700 --> 11:56.660
Till mountains crumble, streams run dry,

11:56.660 --> 11:59.140
thunder rumbles in winter, snow falls in summer.

11:59.140 --> 12:01.660
West of the Yangguan Pass you'll see no more of mine.

12:01.660 --> 12:03.580
I do not know in the celestial sphere.

12:03.580 --> 12:05.100
Men are born sentimental and emotional.

12:05.100 --> 12:06.680
Myriad footpaths with no human traces shown.

12:06.700 --> 12:08.730
For the long years,

12:08.730 --> 12:12.240
to whom can I my grief convey?

12:12.260 --> 12:15.650
Youth do not know real depression.

12:16.100 --> 12:18.920
Time passes indifferently,
turning people from young to old.

12:19.610 --> 12:24.080
Revived even if she be, could she still know me?

12:24.100 --> 12:27.450
Near a cottage a stream flows.

12:28.970 --> 12:31.890
How panic-stricken I was retreating before the Tartars!

12:32.660 --> 12:35.600
Being a captive, I lamented over my solitary confinement.

12:36.100 --> 12:39.650
Who can avert his death since time immemorial?

12:40.460 --> 12:45.040
Let my heart remain true to shine in the annals.

12:52.700 --> 12:55.810
No ancients before me,

12:57.290 --> 13:00.330
nor comers from behind.

13:04.140 --> 13:07.570
Reflecting on the infinite heaven and earth,

13:10.370 --> 13:13.920
Alone, in a sadness sublime, my tears come.

13:27.610 --> 13:29.600
Is it over one hundred?

13:29.930 --> 13:33.250
Mr. Fan, it's way over one hundred.

13:33.490 --> 13:35.350
That'll be enough.

13:35.370 --> 13:39.330
How could there be any fairyland in the world?

13:39.660 --> 13:40.610
If not,

13:40.610 --> 13:42.580
where do all these poems come from?

13:42.580 --> 13:46.130
They must be written by himself!

13:50.460 --> 13:53.960
Even if he writes them all,

13:54.290 --> 13:57.560
even if he writes thousands of poems,

13:57.580 --> 13:59.350
it can't prove that

13:59.370 --> 14:02.530
he didn't copy that poem.

14:02.530 --> 14:05.330
He can recite marvelous poems without thinking.

14:05.370 --> 14:06.710
Why would he

14:06.730 --> 14:08.720
copy other's work?

14:08.900 --> 14:10.890
Why should he?

14:16.970 --> 14:19.280
When it comes to explaining
classic texts and annotating articles,

14:20.100 --> 14:22.080
you win.

14:23.050 --> 14:24.770
But when it comes to reciting poems,

14:25.340 --> 14:27.330
I win.

14:28.730 --> 14:31.250
For a literary giant,

14:32.340 --> 14:34.330
I'm not qualified.

14:35.970 --> 14:37.960
But for a man,

14:39.780 --> 14:43.400
you're not qualified.

14:51.610 --> 14:57.250
Since I am drunk and sleepy, you may go...

14:59.374 --> 15:01.630
go to hell.

15:06.780 --> 15:10.640
What's wrong, Master Zhuang?

15:10.660 --> 15:14.600
-Master Zhuang! -Master Zhuang! -Master Zhuang!

15:15.050 --> 15:17.040
Master Zhuang, wake up!

15:18.610 --> 15:20.890
Get the imperial physician!

15:27.820 --> 15:29.030
Hurry up! Hurry up! Hurry up!

15:29.050 --> 15:31.720
Come on. Put the sober soup on the table.

15:32.220 --> 15:33.710
Put it here! Put it here! Right!

15:33.730 --> 15:34.460
Plump the pillow

15:34.460 --> 15:36.040
to make it soft.

15:36.610 --> 15:37.460
He drank too much.

15:37.460 --> 15:39.130
Make sure he won't get a stiff neck tomorrow.

15:42.490 --> 15:45.350
The plan remains unchanged.
Wait for me outside the palace walls.

15:45.370 --> 15:46.020
Well.

15:46.020 --> 15:47.440
You're so drunk.

15:47.460 --> 15:48.690
Let's make it another day.

15:49.290 --> 15:50.290
He's here! He's here!

15:50.290 --> 15:51.320
Mr. Fan, the poetic genius, is here!

15:51.340 --> 15:52.800
You're here! Hurry up!

15:52.820 --> 15:54.150
Put him on the bed! Put him on the bed!

15:54.170 --> 15:55.690
Be careful! Be careful!

16:00.170 --> 16:01.400
Slow down!

16:02.340 --> 16:03.470
Cover him up!

16:03.490 --> 16:04.840
Hurry up! Hurry up! Hurry up!

16:06.780 --> 16:09.600
Be careful! Cover him up!

16:11.290 --> 16:12.440
Thank you!

16:12.460 --> 16:14.040
You may go back and rest.

16:19.490 --> 16:20.770
Thank you!

16:22.170 --> 16:23.440
I'll take care of my brother.

16:23.460 --> 16:25.080
You may go back and rest.

16:25.410 --> 16:26.900
There're a lot of servants here.

16:26.900 --> 16:29.040
No need to bother you.

16:29.530 --> 16:30.640
Save it!

16:30.660 --> 16:31.680
Enough!

16:31.700 --> 16:33.680
No need to make a fuss.

16:33.700 --> 16:35.720
He's just drunk.

16:36.020 --> 16:37.260
Do you know what your brother has done

16:37.260 --> 16:38.220
in the imperial palace?

16:38.220 --> 16:39.080
What?

16:39.100 --> 16:41.130
He's a well-known poetic genius now.

16:43.340 --> 16:45.160
His Majesty ordered

16:45.780 --> 16:47.100
the imperial guards

16:47.100 --> 16:49.760
to escort His Excellency Fan home.

16:49.780 --> 16:51.520
His Majesty also asked us

16:51.610 --> 16:53.510
to take good care of him.

16:53.530 --> 16:54.710
Now,

16:54.730 --> 16:56.290
he is the treasure of

16:56.290 --> 16:57.920
Nanqing.

16:58.780 --> 17:00.160
You really flatter him.

17:00.780 --> 17:02.120
I mean it.

17:02.140 --> 17:04.460
Your Excellency, you don't know.

17:04.460 --> 17:05.600
Mr. Fan composed poems

17:05.620 --> 17:07.510
out of drunkenness tonight.

17:07.530 --> 17:08.860
Everyone in the Hall

17:08.860 --> 17:11.390
was stunned and startled.

17:11.410 --> 17:12.960
Many said in private that

17:12.980 --> 17:16.290
he's really a poetic genius sent from heaven.

17:22.820 --> 17:24.510
Look at your brother Fan Xian.

17:24.530 --> 17:25.440
He's such a promising young man.

17:25.460 --> 17:27.800
Look at you! You only want to sleep.

17:27.820 --> 17:29.200
Just learn from your brother.

17:29.220 --> 17:31.320
Isn't he also sleeping now?

17:31.340 --> 17:32.890
He...

17:33.130 --> 17:34.380
Ask them to leave.

17:34.380 --> 17:36.130
You are different!

17:37.380 --> 17:38.010
Get up!

17:38.010 --> 17:39.480
It's late.

17:39.530 --> 17:40.910
Go back and rest.

17:40.930 --> 17:41.870
I'll take care of my bother.

17:41.890 --> 17:43.200
No need to rest.

17:43.220 --> 17:44.050
He's become a well-known genius.

17:44.050 --> 17:45.740
We should take good care of him.

17:45.740 --> 17:47.010
Make some midnight snacks in case that

17:47.010 --> 17:48.580
he wants something to eat after waking up.

17:48.580 --> 17:49.250
Come on!

17:49.250 --> 17:49.860
Hurry up!

17:49.860 --> 17:51.010
Enough!

17:53.930 --> 17:55.110
Just leave.

17:55.130 --> 17:56.560
Brother needs to rest.

17:58.460 --> 18:00.050
Go! Go! Leave now!

18:00.050 --> 18:00.870
Let him have a good rest.

18:00.890 --> 18:02.650
Be quiet! Be quiet!

18:07.580 --> 18:08.840
It's time to go.

18:08.860 --> 18:10.130
Let your brother have a good rest.

18:10.130 --> 18:11.010
Hurry up!

18:11.010 --> 18:12.930
We should leave early.

18:21.770 --> 18:23.050
Brother.

18:25.010 --> 18:26.800
Brother, are you OK?

18:37.130 --> 18:38.370
I'm fine.

18:45.290 --> 18:48.890
Did Zhuang Mohan really spit blood?

18:49.500 --> 18:50.720
Yes.

18:53.170 --> 18:54.770
After tonight,

18:55.220 --> 18:58.680
Fan Xian will be known as a poetic genius.

18:59.650 --> 19:01.290
In this case,

19:01.580 --> 19:05.410
Zhuang Mohan has made a lie to frame Fan Xian up.

19:07.170 --> 19:10.270
His good reputation over seventy years

19:10.290 --> 19:12.530
was ruined over one night.

19:16.170 --> 19:18.480
He actually ruined his life

19:18.500 --> 19:21.010
at such an old age.

19:22.580 --> 19:26.960
Well, I'm also tired.

19:27.130 --> 19:30.600
We'll talk tomorrow.

19:48.050 --> 19:49.600
Haven't you taken the medicine?

19:49.620 --> 19:51.370
It helps to vomit.

19:52.860 --> 19:54.030
Ruoruo,

19:54.050 --> 19:55.220
some people in the imperial court

19:55.220 --> 19:56.230
have conspired with Zhuang Mohan.

19:56.250 --> 19:58.130
What happened today is a setup.

19:58.620 --> 19:59.770
Who might they be?

19:59.980 --> 20:02.010
The Princess Royal and Guo Youzhi.

20:02.290 --> 20:03.600
The Princess Royal?

20:04.340 --> 20:05.650
Didn't she defend you

20:05.650 --> 20:07.030
all the time in the Hall?

20:07.050 --> 20:08.150
You're a smart girl.

20:08.170 --> 20:10.050
How can you fall for her trick?

20:12.460 --> 20:14.560
She is really insidious.

20:15.700 --> 20:18.170
I'll sneak into the imperial palace tonight.

20:18.620 --> 20:20.390
But brother, you're too drunk.

20:20.410 --> 20:21.130
Because I'm drunk,

20:21.130 --> 20:22.390
no one will suspect me.

20:22.410 --> 20:23.720
Ruoruo,

20:23.740 --> 20:25.080
guard the room for me.

20:25.100 --> 20:26.530
Don't let anyone in.

20:27.010 --> 20:28.110
I know.

20:28.130 --> 20:29.270
As long as I'm alive,

20:29.290 --> 20:30.800
no one can get in.

20:46.410 --> 20:47.840
Your Excellency.

20:48.580 --> 20:50.010
Wait here.

20:55.100 --> 20:56.370
Uncle.

20:57.050 --> 20:58.560
The plan remains unchanged.

20:58.580 --> 21:00.030
We've got about half an hour.

21:00.050 --> 21:01.720
I'll lure Hong Sixiang away,

21:01.740 --> 21:03.560
and you shall sneak inside to get the key.

21:04.890 --> 21:05.910
Wait!

21:05.930 --> 21:07.170
What's wrong?

21:07.770 --> 21:09.680
You'd better not betray your identity.

21:13.740 --> 21:15.480
I stole the clothes and sword

21:15.500 --> 21:16.620
from the mission of

21:16.620 --> 21:18.170
Dongyi Town.

21:19.820 --> 21:20.870
Yun Zhilan?

21:20.890 --> 21:22.680
There're only a few Ninth Dan martial arts masters

21:22.700 --> 21:24.030
in the capital city.

21:24.050 --> 21:25.580
I want them to think that

21:25.580 --> 21:27.320
the first apprentice of Si Gujian is the one

21:27.340 --> 21:29.370
who sneaks into the imperial palace.

21:30.380 --> 21:31.800
So you've got a plan.

21:31.820 --> 21:32.620
I often sneaked into places

21:32.620 --> 21:34.080
with your mom

21:35.100 --> 21:37.130
back then.

21:37.410 --> 21:39.080
I'm used to that.

21:39.740 --> 21:41.290
Be careful yourself.

21:41.460 --> 21:43.080
You may not be able to

21:43.220 --> 21:44.960
stop Yan Xiaoyi's arrows.

21:45.010 --> 21:46.030
The imperial harem is so big.

21:46.050 --> 21:47.560
I may not run into him.

22:04.380 --> 22:05.440
After writing down so many poems,

22:05.460 --> 22:07.030
your hand must be sore.

22:07.050 --> 22:09.990
Now that there's good news from our literary circles,

22:10.010 --> 22:12.910
it's a happy event rarely seen.

22:12.930 --> 22:14.960
Even if my hand would be broken
for writing down the poems,

22:14.980 --> 22:17.720
I still feel happy from the bottom of my heart.

22:19.380 --> 22:22.080
Your Majesty, are you tired?

22:23.770 --> 22:25.840
I just feel emotional.

22:26.650 --> 22:29.390
Nanqing was founded with military forces.

22:29.410 --> 22:30.630
When it comes to civil administration,

22:30.650 --> 22:32.720
we're far behind compared to Beiqi.

22:33.410 --> 22:34.800
The late emperor

22:34.820 --> 22:37.200
was deeply concerned about it at heart.

22:37.220 --> 22:39.750
God blesses Nanqing.

22:39.770 --> 22:44.200
Now we have Mr. Fan, the poetic genius.

22:44.460 --> 22:45.930
Poetic genius?

22:46.460 --> 22:49.050
Or may be a lost genius?

22:51.010 --> 22:55.080
But the poems

22:55.100 --> 22:56.720
are really good.

23:00.380 --> 23:02.650
But I'm wondering

23:03.650 --> 23:05.960
whether he wrote them or not.

23:33.000 --> 23:34.250
=Hong Sixiang, Head of Eunuchs of Nanqing=

23:34.250 --> 23:34.400
=Hong Sixiang, Head of Eunuchs of Nanqing=
Who are you?

23:34.400 --> 23:36.130
Who are you?

23:39.220 --> 23:41.230
Sorry, it's a mistake.

23:41.250 --> 23:42.770
I've taken the wrong way.

23:43.580 --> 23:45.960
Taking a wrong way to the imperial palace,

23:46.410 --> 23:47.390
you must be the first one

23:47.410 --> 23:49.650
in the world.

23:49.740 --> 23:52.230
I have to work for my country.

23:52.250 --> 23:53.720
Please forgive me.

23:53.740 --> 23:54.910
I'll leave at once.

23:54.930 --> 23:57.130
Lad, this is the imperial palace.

23:57.500 --> 23:58.700
It's not up to you

23:58.700 --> 24:00.720
to leave.

24:25.410 --> 24:26.800
Front!

24:49.860 --> 24:51.360
Back!

24:51.380 --> 24:53.530
You're an apprentice of Si Gujian.

26:03.840 --> 26:06.070
=Yan Xiaoyi, Director of Imperial Guards of Nanqing=

26:07.980 --> 26:09.750
Director Yan, what's wrong?

26:09.770 --> 26:11.890
Have you heard anything?

26:12.980 --> 26:14.170
No.

26:15.530 --> 26:16.800
Get me my bow.

26:16.820 --> 26:18.050
Yes.

27:20.410 --> 27:22.600
Judged from our experience in the Taiping Residence,

27:22.620 --> 27:25.390
Yan Xiaoyi has exceptionally good hearing.

27:25.410 --> 27:26.560
If you get close,

27:26.580 --> 27:29.320
he'll notice whenever you go wrong.

27:29.700 --> 27:32.290
When you enter the imperial palace,

27:32.530 --> 27:34.370
don't run or jump.

27:46.530 --> 27:48.840
Director Yan, is there anything wrong?

27:50.770 --> 27:52.390
Nothing sounds strange.

27:52.410 --> 27:53.870
The leopard cats kept by the imperial consorts

27:53.890 --> 27:55.080
are really fat.

27:55.100 --> 27:56.580
They might cause the sound

27:56.580 --> 27:58.170
just now.

28:00.500 --> 28:02.320
Keep patrolling.

28:02.340 --> 28:03.600
Yes.

28:23.530 --> 28:26.410
Another thing you should be cautious about.

28:27.130 --> 28:28.440
Never go high.

28:28.460 --> 28:30.170
That's right.

28:34.620 --> 28:36.050
Besides his good hearing,

28:36.050 --> 28:37.840
Yan Xiaoyi is an archer.

28:37.860 --> 28:40.320
For archers, their eyes are the best.

28:40.340 --> 28:41.720
If I go high,

28:41.740 --> 28:42.960
thought it's late at night,

28:42.980 --> 28:45.250
he might still see me.

30:29.700 --> 30:30.800
Wang Qinian.

30:30.820 --> 30:32.050
Your Excellency.

30:32.380 --> 30:33.560
Get me the locksmith.

30:48.340 --> 30:51.200
Just copy this key.

30:52.100 --> 30:53.320
It's not a key.

30:53.340 --> 30:55.650
There's no such key

30:56.170 --> 30:58.170
or such lock in the world.

30:58.650 --> 30:59.910
You're fooled?

30:59.930 --> 31:01.080
Whatever it is,

31:01.100 --> 31:02.250
can you make a copy?

31:02.500 --> 31:05.650
Ingenious as it is,

31:06.130 --> 31:06.990
it takes time.

31:07.010 --> 31:07.870
Just make a general model.

31:07.890 --> 31:09.480
No need to focus on the details.

31:09.820 --> 31:10.800
Do it roughly?

31:10.820 --> 31:12.410
Right. How long will it take?

31:12.460 --> 31:14.050
Without paying attention to the details,

31:14.740 --> 31:16.480
it'll take about fifteen minutes.

31:32.530 --> 31:33.630
Wait a moment.

31:33.650 --> 31:34.960
I need to pee. I need to pee.

31:34.980 --> 31:36.440
Go ahead. Go ahead.

32:04.820 --> 32:06.170
What're you staring at?

32:06.380 --> 32:07.530
Let me tell you.

32:07.580 --> 32:08.720
Just now, a weirdo

32:08.740 --> 32:09.960
fell from here

32:09.980 --> 32:10.820
to the ground.

32:10.820 --> 32:11.630
The he stepped onto an umbrella

32:11.650 --> 32:12.800
and flied away.

32:12.820 --> 32:14.620
Then an old eunuch

32:14.620 --> 32:16.750
flied through the air like an arrow.

32:16.770 --> 32:18.290
Like an arrow.

32:18.740 --> 32:21.480
Look, the floor tiles are broken.

32:22.650 --> 32:24.270
This is the fake one.

32:24.290 --> 32:26.480
And this is the real one.

32:28.220 --> 32:29.440
Thank you.

32:30.170 --> 32:31.320
Who said it's a key?

32:31.340 --> 32:32.630
What lock can it open?

32:32.650 --> 32:33.800
Stop asking so many questions.

32:33.820 --> 32:35.080
Yes.

32:43.580 --> 32:44.440
Your Excellency.

32:44.460 --> 32:45.560
No need to follow me.

32:45.580 --> 32:46.990
I'll put the fake one back.

32:47.010 --> 32:48.440
After that, I'll go back myself.

32:48.460 --> 32:49.650
OK.

32:49.700 --> 32:52.910
Your Excellency, this is a top secret, right?

32:52.930 --> 32:54.270
I trust you.

32:54.290 --> 32:57.680
Well, how should we deal with the locksmith?

32:58.740 --> 33:00.170
What do you mean?

33:00.220 --> 33:04.030
Should we get rid of him?

33:04.050 --> 33:05.050
We only asked him to make a key.

33:05.050 --> 33:06.480
No need to kill him for that.

33:06.820 --> 33:07.750
Give him a good pay

33:07.770 --> 33:08.910
and send him out of the capital city tonight.

33:08.930 --> 33:11.290
Ask him to stay outside for a while.

33:16.220 --> 33:18.080
Are you testing me?

33:18.620 --> 33:20.480
Your Excellency, you're bold

33:20.500 --> 33:22.200
but soft-hearted.

33:22.700 --> 33:23.620
Is that a good thing?

33:23.620 --> 33:25.560
If you want to do great things,

33:25.770 --> 33:27.030
you're too merciful.

33:27.050 --> 33:29.720
But you'll make a good friend.

33:31.820 --> 33:33.580
Your Excellency, there's one more thing.

33:33.580 --> 33:34.270
Go ahead.

33:34.290 --> 33:36.110
Since you want to give him a good pay,

33:36.130 --> 33:39.080
you should give me the money.

33:41.220 --> 33:42.100
Where can I get money

33:42.100 --> 33:42.890
for you late at night?

33:42.890 --> 33:43.990
Pay it for me now.

33:44.010 --> 33:44.910
Your Excellency,

33:44.930 --> 33:46.050
can you write me

33:46.050 --> 33:46.960
a loan receipt

33:46.980 --> 33:48.700
so that I can

33:48.700 --> 33:50.150
gain some interests.

33:50.170 --> 33:51.560
Fuck off!

33:53.930 --> 33:55.650
Your Excellency, please be careful.

33:57.220 --> 33:59.650
Everything goes on smoothly this time.

33:59.740 --> 34:01.080
After putting back the fake key,

34:01.100 --> 34:03.150
we can complete the mission successfully.

34:03.170 --> 34:05.150
I just hope there will be no accident.

34:05.170 --> 34:06.560
Avoid trouble

34:06.580 --> 34:08.030
and don't raise new issues.

34:08.050 --> 34:09.840
You should be fine.

34:51.250 --> 34:53.760
The Princess Royal is waiting for you inside.

35:21.970 --> 35:23.400
Your Highness.

35:23.420 --> 35:25.990
If love between both sides can last for aye,

35:26.010 --> 35:28.930
why need they stay together night and day?

35:29.210 --> 35:32.970
Love is depicted so well
that it almost makes me heartbroken.

35:35.420 --> 35:36.760
Take a seat.

35:37.970 --> 35:40.170
I had copied some of Fan Xian's poems

35:40.530 --> 35:43.190
on the banquet.

35:43.210 --> 35:44.400
Even now,

35:44.420 --> 35:46.520
those poems seem marvelous.

35:46.940 --> 35:48.470
What do you think?

35:48.490 --> 35:49.760
Indeed.

35:49.970 --> 35:52.750
The poems are amazing.

35:52.770 --> 35:54.370
Can there really be a fairyland

35:54.420 --> 35:56.450
in the world?

35:57.940 --> 36:01.760
Fairyland is purely imaginary.

36:01.940 --> 36:03.490
I actually think

36:03.690 --> 36:05.080
these poems

36:05.490 --> 36:08.760
are written by Mr. Fan himself.

36:09.010 --> 36:12.270
Writing hundreds of excellent poems without a break,

36:12.290 --> 36:14.430
it's beyond common sense.

36:14.450 --> 36:15.920
Is he really a genius

36:15.940 --> 36:18.210
descended from heaven?

36:19.970 --> 36:21.800
If he's a genius descended from heaven,

36:21.820 --> 36:23.880
then he's definitely

36:23.900 --> 36:26.890
a poetic genius.

36:30.180 --> 36:32.210
I summoned you tonight

36:32.250 --> 36:34.280
to ask you something.

36:35.620 --> 36:37.710
You promised me to

36:37.730 --> 36:40.030
humiliate Fan Xian

36:40.050 --> 36:41.560
and ruin his name on the banquet.

36:41.580 --> 36:43.430
Have you lived up to your word?

36:43.450 --> 36:46.120
I framed Fan Xian up today

36:46.140 --> 36:49.280
at the cost of my good reputation.

36:49.770 --> 36:52.520
Though I've lost,

36:53.180 --> 36:55.890
I'm utterly convinced.

36:55.970 --> 36:58.970
But there's one thing I don't understand.

36:59.380 --> 37:01.800
Your Highness didn't tell me in advance that

37:02.340 --> 37:07.370
Fan Xian is a poetic genius,

37:07.970 --> 37:09.450
or I wouldn't have made

37:09.490 --> 37:12.080
a fool of myself.

37:13.250 --> 37:15.240
I didn't expect that

37:15.450 --> 37:18.190
he's so genius.

37:18.210 --> 37:19.250
That's fine.

37:19.250 --> 37:22.320
You lost. How can it be fine?

37:23.940 --> 37:26.880
Luckily he wrote

37:26.900 --> 37:29.950
over one hundred poems overnight.

37:29.970 --> 37:31.650
Otherwise,

37:32.180 --> 37:33.640
the world

37:33.660 --> 37:37.430
would be misled by me

37:37.450 --> 37:38.880
and think him as

37:38.900 --> 37:40.840
a shameless person

37:40.860 --> 37:42.650
who copied other's work.

37:43.660 --> 37:45.240
He's unharmed,

37:45.490 --> 37:48.450
but your reputation is completely ruined.

37:49.530 --> 37:51.280
That's better than

37:51.490 --> 37:54.080
feeling guilty all my life.

37:54.660 --> 37:57.840
You're relieved. What about me?

37:58.620 --> 38:00.880
Thanks to me, you caught Yan Bingyun

38:00.900 --> 38:03.000
to exchange Xiao En back to Beiqi.

38:04.050 --> 38:06.240
In the world, how many people know

38:06.420 --> 38:08.470
the vicious villain Xiao En

38:08.490 --> 38:10.050
is actually the younger brother of

38:10.050 --> 38:12.000
the literary giant Zhuang Mohan?

38:12.420 --> 38:14.450
I helped you and Beiqi

38:14.730 --> 38:16.010
in defiance of world opinions.

38:16.010 --> 38:17.360
I did you such a big favor,

38:17.380 --> 38:18.210
only to be told that

38:18.210 --> 38:19.800
you are relieved.

38:23.860 --> 38:26.410
If I were not trapped by family affection,

38:28.100 --> 38:30.400
how would I come to Nanqing

38:30.420 --> 38:33.690
and fall into your trap?

38:36.730 --> 38:37.340
Go back

38:37.340 --> 38:39.030
and tell that little emperor of yours.

38:39.050 --> 38:40.800
He owes me.

38:40.940 --> 38:44.560
He'll have to pay me back in future.

38:54.050 --> 38:57.210
I'm confused about one thing.

38:59.050 --> 39:01.410
Young and talented

39:01.530 --> 39:03.240
as Fan Xian is,

39:03.340 --> 39:04.860
he will be the pillar of Nanqing

39:04.860 --> 39:07.450
in future.

39:07.660 --> 39:09.800
Your Highness,

39:09.820 --> 39:12.280
why do you have to kill him?

39:13.180 --> 39:14.400
You even gave away

39:14.420 --> 39:17.490
the secret agent of your Investigator's Office!

39:23.900 --> 39:26.320
Yan Bingyun did suffer a little,

39:27.690 --> 39:29.890
but he's still alive.

39:30.490 --> 39:31.730
As to why I have to

39:31.730 --> 39:34.210
kill Fan Xian,

39:35.140 --> 39:36.250
I just love to see him

39:36.250 --> 39:38.210
helpless.

40:35.770 --> 40:37.650
There's an assassin!

42:11.770 --> 42:13.240
Did it miss?

42:22.420 --> 42:24.000
The arrowhead is broken,

42:24.210 --> 42:26.000
and there are scraps of clothes.

42:26.180 --> 42:27.670
He must be shot.

42:27.690 --> 42:29.080
There's no blood.

42:29.100 --> 42:30.800
Is he unharmed?

42:32.580 --> 42:35.210
Whoever shot by me must be injured.

42:35.450 --> 42:37.950
Split up and search for him carefully.

42:37.970 --> 42:39.280
Yes.

43:13.320 --> 43:16.900
In the river of history,

43:16.920 --> 43:20.390
time goes round and round.

43:23.200 --> 43:26.540
Memories about the former and present lives

43:26.560 --> 43:30.630
join each other in an endless way.

43:32.520 --> 43:35.140
In the long drunken Milky Way,

43:35.160 --> 43:37.400
one season follows another in a flash,

43:37.400 --> 43:39.900
and the wild geese are flying south.

43:39.920 --> 43:41.520
I just can't give up

43:41.520 --> 43:44.860
to be with you for my whole life.

43:44.880 --> 43:50.350
I have been hovering in the dreams
for hundreds and thousands of times.

43:51.600 --> 43:54.150
I can't even say a word when I watch the flowers falling.

43:54.440 --> 43:56.480
Year after year in the wandering,

43:56.480 --> 43:59.140
I count the remaining years.

43:59.160 --> 44:01.340
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:01.360 --> 44:03.350
even though we have ended up the destiny,

44:03.640 --> 44:06.030
I never feel regretful.

44:06.080 --> 44:07.440
In such a chaotic world,

44:07.440 --> 44:10.420
I still miss you as ever.

44:10.440 --> 44:13.390
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:13.680 --> 44:15.740
With a gentle heart,

44:15.760 --> 44:18.420
I cherish our remaining years.

44:18.440 --> 44:19.960
Even though we have to go through

44:19.960 --> 44:22.470
all the hardships along the journey,

44:22.600 --> 44:29.790
you always stay by my side,

44:29.880 --> 44:32.550
watching the falling flowers, speechlessly.

44:32.840 --> 44:34.920
Year after year in the wandering,

44:34.920 --> 44:37.580
I count the remaining years.

44:37.600 --> 44:39.740
Even though we can't meet each other anymore,

44:39.760 --> 44:41.990
even though we end up the destiny,

44:42.200 --> 44:44.380
I never feel regretful.

44:44.400 --> 44:45.800
In such a chaotic world,

44:45.800 --> 44:48.860
I still miss you as ever.

44:48.880 --> 44:51.990
I can't fall asleep under the moon.

44:52.080 --> 44:54.220
With a gentle heart,

44:54.240 --> 44:56.940
I cherish our remaining years.

44:56.960 --> 44:58.400
Even though we have to go through

44:58.400 --> 45:01.060
all the hardships along the journey,

45:01.080 --> 45:09.840
you always stay by my side...
